(Footnotes) Tj T*
(To make the levels concrete, consider a routine piece of infrastructure work: a nightly data) Tj T*
(pipeline has broken and needs fixing before tomorrow's run.) Tj T*
(At AL3 \("collaborates"\), an engineer would come to Claude with logs from the failed runs. They) Tj T*
